---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Aviation Live Desk | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Weekly Aviation Live Desk: who’s live right now, weather that matters, heavies due at MCO, and links to the board."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Product 4</p>
      <h1>Aviation Live Desk</h1>
      <p>
        The desk is how the directory and the channel feed each other. A weekly hosted stream from home or a Hyatt —
        not a 24/7 cam, not a restream of someone else.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Here’s who’s live right now on the board</li>
        <li>Weather that actually changes the show</li>
        <li>Heavies due at MCO</li>
        <li>Links on screen to airportrunwaylive.com</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Target window: Wednesday 4–7pm Eastern, announced on YouTube until it is weekly. Super Chat and memberships
        stay on YouTube. This domain does not take tips.
      </p>
      <p>
        If a 24/7 roof cam ever exists, it is a tile on the board. It does not replace talking on mic.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-amber" href={site.youtube} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the desk on YouTube</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/live">Open the board</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/schedule">Schedule</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
